Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me and a happy smiling shining happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.72,0:40:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, mega lucky super sparkly lucky train
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Adventure's just around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.98,0:40:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, my lucky tain!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.86,0:40:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Cinderella, and the clock's struck midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.95,0:40:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,(too bad)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.33,0:40:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You want everyone to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.33,0:40:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(let's dance!)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.46,0:40:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bid yourself from that night "goodbye"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.25,0:40:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz tomorrow's back to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.96,0:40:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just an unpolished gem
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you just have to keep polishing yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless hours passing by
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.69,0:41:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's your super shiny, ultra sparkly lucky time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.65,0:41:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a wish upon a shooting star before it passes you by
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can once again board that ultra cheerful happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.24,0:41:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe sometimes you'll slip up
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.37,0:41:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but that might lead you to your treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.75,0:41:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.04,0:41:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding and thrilling -- oh my lucky train!
